    "detailed_description": "<h1>Cozy Pet Life Idle is coming in Q4 2025!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist</strong> now to get notified when your new desktop companion arrives.</p></p><br><h1>25% of Game Revenue Will Feed Stray Animals in T\u00fcrkiye!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re committed to making a difference.<br>25% of all Cozy Pet Life Idle revenue will go directly toward feeding stray animals across T\u00fcrkiye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will transparently share donation receipts, visuals, and progress updates through our founder\u2019s UPI Games LinkedIn profile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By playing, you\u2019re not just adopting a digital pet \u2014 you\u2019re helping real ones survive.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cozy pet lives on your desktop \u2014 no stress, no timers. Just a peaceful idle experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adopt a cat, dog, or other animal. While you work, study, or simply relax, watch it dig for resources. Feed it, heal it when sick, and show affection when it's sad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/d7bf7f0dc82bd711ca2e38fd08412ddc.poster.avif?t=1755426876\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/d7bf7f0dc82bd711ca2e38fd08412ddc.webm?t=1755426876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/d7bf7f0dc82bd711ca2e38fd08412ddc.mp4?t=1755426876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Digging Mechanic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you go about your daily tasks, your pet stays active in the background. Cats dig for fish, dogs for bones, and bunnies for carrots \u2014 each species has its own resource. It doesn\u2019t need constant attention, but it\u2019s always ready for interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/ac3703ddbe682d559105b5f2440d987f.poster.avif?t=1755426876\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/ac3703ddbe682d559105b5f2440d987f.webm?t=1755426876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/ac3703ddbe682d559105b5f2440d987f.mp4?t=1755426876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feed, Pet, Heal, Repeat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your pet happy by feeding it regularly and showing love when it\u2019s down. Heal it with a single click when it\u2019s sick. These interactions boost its energy and happiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/128248088ea5160c7ff95bc74e45ef73.poster.avif?t=1755426876\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/128248088ea5160c7ff95bc74e45ef73.webm?t=1755426876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/128248088ea5160c7ff95bc74e45ef73.mp4?t=1755426876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Species-Specific Shops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each animal has its own themed shop with items that boost stats and influence animations. Cats get pillows, dogs get toys, bunnies get tunnels \u2014 everything is tailored and adorable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/f058b3c346681a78c057dd3b68f316cd.poster.avif?t=1755426876\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/f058b3c346681a78c057dd3b68f316cd.webm?t=1755426876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/f058b3c346681a78c057dd3b68f316cd.mp4?t=1755426876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Desktop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your desktop background. Your pet doesn\u2019t live inside a window \u2014 it lives <strong>on</strong> your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/e19abf8721ee86ec85431b54d8555617.poster.avif?t=1755426876\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/e19abf8721ee86ec85431b54d8555617.webm?t=1755426876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/e19abf8721ee86ec85431b54d8555617.mp4?t=1755426876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
