/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feed, Pet, Heal, Repeat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your pet happy by feeding it regularly and showing love when it\u2019s down. Heal it with a single click when it\u2019s sick. These interactions boost its energy and happiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/128248088ea5160c7ff95bc74e45ef73.poster.avif?t=1755426876\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/128248088ea5160c7ff95bc74e45ef73.webm?t=1755426876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/128248088ea5160c7ff95bc74e45ef73.mp4?t=1755426876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Species-Specific Shops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each animal has its own themed shop with items that boost stats and influence animations. Cats get pillows, dogs get toys, bunnies get tunnels \u2014 everything is tailored and adorable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/f058b3c346681a78c057dd3b68f316cd.poster.avif?t=1755426876\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/f058b3c346681a78c057dd3b68f316cd.webm?t=1755426876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/f058b3c346681a78c057dd3b68f316cd.mp4?t=1755426876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Desktop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your desktop background. Your pet doesn\u2019t live inside a window \u2014 it lives <strong>on</strong> your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/e19abf8721ee86ec85431b54d8555617.poster.avif?t=1755426876\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/e19abf8721ee86ec85431b54d8555617.webm?t=1755426876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875660/extras/e19abf8721ee86ec85431b54d8555617.mp4?t=1755426876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
